    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "657bd58f-5d26-4e44-9149-a8c02fd43383",
        "name": "Overview",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "position": [
          112,
          416
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "width": 424,
          "height": 556,
          "content": "## AI Job Matcher\nFinds new jobs every day, scores them against your profile with Claude, and sends the best ones to Telegram or Gmail.\n\n### How it works\n1. **Daily schedule** starts the run.\n2. **Apify** returns open jobs that match your search.\n3. Jobs already in your Google Sheet are dropped.\n4. **Claude** scores the new jobs 0-10. The top N are sent and logged.\n\n### Setup\n- [ ] Add credentials: Apify, Anthropic, Google Sheets, and Telegram and/or Gmail\n- [ ] Create a sheet tab `Jobs` with this header row: id, title, company, location, applyUrl, score, reason, sent, status, loggedAt\n- [ ] Fill in **Search Settings**\n- [ ] Run once, then activate\n\n### Customization tips\nChange the run time, topN, the spend cap or the Claude model in **Search Settings**."
        },
        "typeVersion": 1
      },
      {
